    notes: ATCC173 and TOGO M2399 list 19 g Middlebrook 7H10 agar as a separate input
      from 5 mL glycerol, 100 mL OADC and 900 mL water. This source-qualified identity
      denotes that base input. NCIT:C85509 describes the enriched complete medium,
      including OADC and glycerol, and cannot be asserted as its exact identity. The
      unqualified source label is retained only as non-resolving REJECTED_LABEL. Manufacturer,
      complete base formulation, component IDs and roles are not established and are
      not invented.
